# Risk Register

| ID | Risk | Impact | Probability | Mitigation |
|----|------|---------|-------------|------------|
| R1 | Delay in server provisioning | High | Medium | Escalate early |
| R2 | Resource unavailability | Medium | Medium | Backup resource |
| R3 | Network dependency | High | High | Weekly review |
| R4 | Scope changes | High | Medium | Change control |
| R5 | Security approval delay | Medium | Medium | Early engagement |
